Mattaniah son of Mika, the son of Zabdi, the son of Asaph, the director who led in thanksgiving and prayer;
    Bakbukiah, second among his associates;
    and Abda son of Shammua, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun.

while other people from both Judah and Benjamin lived in Jerusalem):

    From the descendants of Judah:
    Athaiah son of Uzziah, the son of Zechariah, the son of Amariah, the son of Shephatiah, the son of Mahalalel, a descendant of Perez;

In the days of Joiakim, these were the heads of the priestly families:

    of Seraiah’s family, Meraiah;
    of Jeremiah’s, Hananiah;
